---
// «العودة إلى الأعلى», for pages that hold up to 1000 rows. No script: the
// track starts one screen down the page and the button is sticky inside it,
// so it shows up once the reader has scrolled past the first screen, stays in
// the corner down to the end of the page, and never exists on a short page.
---
<div class="to-top-track">
  <a class="to-top" href="#top">
    <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
    <span>إلى الأعلى</span>
  </a>
</div>
